    Herat
    EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
    The SDES in Herat Province was conducted in March 2016. It covered 13 districts
    and around 2,040 Enumeration Areas (EAs). Due to security problems, the districts
    of Gulran, Shindand and Fersi were not covered. This survey is considered an
    important milestone for CSO since Herat is the 10th province in which SDES has
    been successfully conducted.

